        {
          "exampleId": "w:capacity#e-d69ee42b54eb9467",
          "text": "For the biggest stadiums in the world, we have used data supplied by the World Atlas list so far, which ranks them by their stated permanent capacity, as well as updated information from official stadium websites.",
